# Pass "avec-ads2": A Dog Said... Animal Prosthetics 2 beside this mod, and nothing else optional.
#
# SamBucher.ADogSaidAnimalProsthetics2, Workshop 3238353862, supports 1.4, 1.5 and 1.6, declares no hard
# dependency and lists a long series of optional mods in its own loadAfter, none of which is staged here.
# XML Extensions is deliberately left out: with it, ADS 2 turns its category system into a setting and does
# not copy the category lists the way this pass reads them.
#
# This mod claims the integration, so the pass is applicable (Tests/Pickle/README.md). It plays
# 08-animal-prosthetics-2, which asserts that the nine species end up offered the surgeries of their category,
# and 01-the-mod-loads, which asserts nothing logged names the mod's defs with ADS 2 loaded.
#
# The item has to be in the WSL install's Workshop cache before this pass can stage it. That is a download,
# so it goes through Use-Wsl.ps1 like any other work on the machine (PickleTools/Headless/README.md, "The
# lock is about the machine"). It has not been downloaded.
SamBucher.ADogSaidAnimalProsthetics2   3238353862
